      "html": "<div class=\"ds-head\"><h2 class=\"ds-h\"><span class=\"ds-mark\"></span><span class=\"ds-ht\">News</span></h2><p class=\"ds-ribbon\">お知らせ</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-head{font-family:'Zen Maru Gothic',sans-serif;color:var(--color-ink,#2b1d1f);} .ds-h{position:relative;display:inline-block;margin:0;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,7vw,4.75rem);font-weight:900;line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-.01em;text-transform:uppercase;} .ds-mark{position:absolute;bottom:-.06em;left:-3%;width:106%;height:.42em;background:var(--color-yellow,#fbd96e);border-radius:2px 8px 6px 3px;clip-path:inset(0 100% 0 0);transition:clip-path 300ms cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);} .ds-head:hover .ds-mark{clip-path:inset(0 0 0 0);} .ds-ht{position:relative;} .ds-ribbon{width:fit-content;margin:12px 0 0;padding:2px 20px 2px 12px;background:var(--color-pink-deep,#b0304f);color:var(--color-paper-light,#fdeee1);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;clip-path:polygon(0 0,100% 0,calc(100% - 8px) 50%,100% 100%,0 100%);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Taped Photo",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "紙にマスキングテープで留めた写真。白い余白、傾き、紙に貼った物の影。",
      "html": "<figure class=\"ds-photo\"><div class=\"ds-img\"></div><span class=\"ds-tape ds-t1\"></span><span class=\"ds-tape ds-t2\"></span></figure>",
      "css": ".ds-photo{position:relative;width:280px;margin:16px;padding:8px;background:var(--color-paper-light,#fdeee1);rotate:-2deg;box-shadow:0 10px 18px -10px rgba(43,29,31,.5);} .ds-img{aspect-ratio:4/3;background:var(--color-navy,#23365e);} .ds-tape{position:absolute;top:-12px;height:24px;mix-blend-mode:multiply;} .ds-t1{left:12%;width:80px;rotate:-6deg;background:rgb(224 69 111/.7);} .ds-t2{right:10%;width:64px;rotate:8deg;background:rgb(122 189 197/.8);}"
    },
